1103
01:30:12,938 --> 01:30:15,007
You never left.

1104
01:32:56,001 --> 01:32:58,337
What is Skylight?

1105
01:33:00,339 --> 01:33:02,107
It's life-changing.

1106
01:33:02,241 --> 01:33:05,511
What is Skylight?
I don't like the term "self-help."

1107
01:33:05,644 --> 01:33:07,847
Self-help looks inward.

1108
01:33:07,980 --> 01:33:09,915
That's where we start,
but big picture,

1109
01:33:10,048 --> 01:33:11,583
Skylight looks out.

1110
01:33:11,717 --> 01:33:15,387
Through barrier therapy,
or BT as we call it,

1111
01:33:15,521 --> 01:33:19,224
we push past our limits
and obliterate the boundaries

1112
01:33:19,358 --> 01:33:21,827
between who we are
and who we want to be.

1113
01:33:21,960 --> 01:33:25,464
Which is why I couldn't be more
excited to be opening The Aviary,

1114
01:33:25,597 --> 01:33:27,666
our new campus
in the heart of the Southwest.

1115
01:33:27,800 --> 01:33:28,835
Full immersion.

1116
01:33:28,967 --> 01:33:30,202
Most people spend their lives

1117
01:33:30,335 --> 01:33:33,705
looking at the world
from inside a cage.

1118
01:33:33,840 --> 01:33:35,040
It's a cage they build.

1119
01:33:35,174 --> 01:33:36,775
It's a cage
they imprison themselves in.

1120
01:33:36,910 --> 01:33:38,510
Here at The Aviary,

1121
01:33:39,545 --> 01:33:43,015
we're gonna deconstruct
those cages one bar at a time.

1122
01:33:43,148 --> 01:33:47,453
So, no, I don't...
I don't control anybody.

1123
01:33:49,154 --> 01:33:51,690
I just want to help people fly.

